  "display_title": "I Want to Prey on You",
  "description": "Ordered into a political marriage with a northern tribe, Princess Eun-Woo wanders out in distress and encounters a massive tiger with an injured paw. As she treats the tiger’s wound, she tells the tiger that he may “eat her” out of despair. Baek Hwi, the king of the tiger clan, is lost for words but is ignited with a different kind of hunger. Unable to forget her, the tiger king begins relentlessly pursuing Eun-Woo, determined to make her his mate…\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
